                <pb facs="0593" n="513" xml:id="pg513"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Lardy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                            1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have directed Minister Hardy to make appropriate acknowledgment of the eloquent
                    message of the President of the Confederation which you communicated by your
                    telegram of yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
